<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves slip to $3.57 bln - Oct 9.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves slip to $3.57 bln - Oct 9.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Friday said its hard currency reserves slipped to $3.570 billion as of October 9, from $3.651 billion on October</p>
<p>2.  HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Oct 9     Oct 2     Oct '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.570     3.651     2.873</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.254     1.185     1.556</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.824     4.836     4.429</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
